    "flood": {
      "name": "Flood",
      "description": "Floodplain farms gain silt (+50% food in summer and autumn). Buildings that aren't flood-tolerant are disabled for the season and cost 2 materials to repair. Levees block both the damage and the silt; a weir halves the flooded area.",
